== Overview ==
'''iamEvan''' is a secret [[Enemies|enemy]] that can only be spawned by admins, and when spawned it has a base health of 10. It is based off of Toilet Tower Defense's [[Developers|programmer]] iamEvan.

== Appearance ==
'''IamEvan''' looks exactly like his [https://www.roblox.com/users/1391475335/profile Roblox Avatar], and his legs are bent to the back and floating.

== Waves ==
This enemy does not spawn anywhere and only can be spawned by an admin.
== Strategy ==
*This enemy's base health is very weak, being only 10. 
*The admin who spawned this enemy can change the wave health it will spawn at, possibly making it have infinite health.
== Trivia ==

* This enemy is based off of Toilet Tower Defense's code scripter [https://www.youtube.com/@iamEvan_/featured iamEvan].
*This enemy was showcased in one of iamEvan's videos and one of Telanthric's videos.
*Since the admins can change its health, it could possibly have negative health.
*

